ideas for archetypes

- spotter
    category: warfare
    desc: focus on precision/accuracy, playfield awareness, human warfare expertise, rifles, warfare vs humans
    archetype: spotter
        callmark
        spot
    perks
        rifleman
        deadeye
        cybereye
        dikec stance
        teamcom

- medic
    * defibrillate   
    * zone medicine (daily med brew (long buff) after sleeping near camp)
    * portable farmacy (cutting more powerful meds)
    * bandages always available

- zone professor
    - expert in anomalous entities
    * human mutation expertise 

- trapper
    - beast mutation expertise 
    * aoe tracking (mark all nearby beast upon entering combat)
    * echolocation: aoe tracking near monsters as long as they are visible. excluding invisible monsters
    * track: tracks nearby smarts to create heatmaps
    * dersu spirit: chance to spawn a ghost pseudodog during an encounter  
        - https://www.moddb.com/mods/stalker-anomaly/addons/phantoms-01
- arena master
    * (in arena matches) extra ammo, smuggled gun, chance to join with you
    * extra wagers
    * la zhola (active auto random proc) + dispersion
    * curva sud (active auto random) + resistence 
- smuggler
    * enable trade with all npc
    * black market discount 
    * workshop parts inventory

- tech buddy
  * let you use his toolkits for repair
  * workshop parts inventory when trading: parts, guns, armour (based on rank)
  
- diplomat
    - can talk with everyone
    - increase intimidation chance (when required)
    - chance for an enemy to turn friendly during combat for a time
- radioman
    - can radio anyone (no friendship required)
- courier
    - can carry stuff for you
- guide
    - avoid random *encounter, decreses travel cd, decreases travel cost
        * need to add random encounter mechanic when fast traveling
- brawler
    - distract npc with aggro
- scout
    - scout: leaves squad to go scout random smarts and meet at near friendly base?
    - awareness: aoe mark in (previous visited?) smarts location of all item of interests
    (specialist, snipers and smg)
- gunzzler
    Activate feats when drunk
    - double dee: double vision double damage (only the player) (passive on drunk status)
    - halitosis: aoe effect inhebriation, increase damage for anyone close to actor (5 meters) (active)

- gunman
    a gunslinging class, focused on destrous feats 
    check on your mark perk from exp

- squad leader
 - stance based class
 * drill sergeant (formation stance)
 * resistence stance
 * speed stance
 * stealth stance buffs (crouch, prone) 

- reward based (slim shady, briber, Baksheesh)
 - increase chance of getting stashes from task completion
 - increase money from tasks
 - trading boons?
 - increase money from loot

- troubadour
 * gives buffs by playing instruments

- deep zone (aka deep state)
 - spy based class, based on knowledge unlock
 * unlocks npcs menu (all nps, profiles always shown, etc)
 * unlocks identification widget
 * unlocks real price in trades
 * and other unlocks


- monolith class
 * mind control

